# Figures (reference/components/figure.md). Page area of 260 × 160 from (20, 20), which ends at y = 180; lines of 12
# (Size 10) and 5 pt per character.
#
# toc lists the figures (f1 and f2: two entries of 12, 24 high) and toc2 the tables (t1: one entry, 12). f1 is an image
# of 100 × 60 with its caption below (12): 72 high, at 20 + 24 + 12 = 56. t1 has its caption above (12) and a table of
# two rows of 12 (24): 36 high, at 128, which ends at 164. f2 (an image of 30 and its caption, 42) does not fit in the
# 16 left and is not split: it goes whole to page 2, at 20, and p (one line: "Véase la figura 2." is 18 characters,
# 90 pt) follows at 62. The captions carry the number of their counter: "1 Esquema", "1 Bornes", "2 Detalle".
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 300
		Height: 200
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
	Section:
		Table of contents:
			Id: toc
			Of: figures
		Table of contents:
			Id: toc2
			Of: tables
		Figure:
			Id: f1
			Caption: Esquema
				Id: c1
			Image: test/wide.png
				Id: i1
				Alt: El esquema
				Box:
					Width: 100
					Height: 60
		Figure:
			Id: t1
			Caption: Bornes
				Id: c2
			Table:
				Id: tb
				Column sizes: * *
				Body:
					Row:
						Cell: L
						Cell: Fase
					Row:
						Cell: N
						Cell: Neutro
		Figure:
			Id: f2
			Caption: Detalle
				Id: c3
			Image: test/wide.png
				Id: i2
				Alt: El detalle
				Box:
					Width: 100
					Height: 30
		Text: Véase la figura {number of: f2}.
			Id: p
